<title>POLAND: WEDEL SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 5.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 5.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.11 vs   2.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.75 vs   4.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.31 vs   4.04</p>
<p> Sales		   57.98 vs  41.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.90 vs  17.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	29.88 vs  34.46</p>
<p> Operating profit    25.21 vs  26.57</p>
<p> Sales		  451.88 vs 311.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is E Wedel Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Cukierniczego SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
